# data/locked_predictions/ is deliberately NOT gitignored - it's a real,
# permanent, git-tracked snapshot of what this project predicted before
# games were played (the whole point is an honest, tamper-evident record
# for after-the-fact accuracy comparison, not another regenerated cache).

# Data files that live outside data/ (component-local outputs)
src/injury_severity_lookup.csv

# Models
models/*.pkl
!models/__init__.py

